This template is derived from the NTU Thesis LaTeX Template by Hsin-Hsiang
Peng (Hsins), which is also MIT licensed:

    https://github.com/Hsins/NTU-Thesis-LaTeX-Template

The MIT terms above cover the LaTeX source, the class file, the scripts, and
the documentation in this repository. They do not extend to material this
repository merely reproduces:

  - figures/seal.pdf and figures/seal-grayscale.pdf are the National Taiwan
    University seal, the property of the university.
  - front/verification-letter.pdf and front/verification-letter-doctor.pdf are
    official blank forms published by NTU's Office of Academic Affairs
    (教務處) at https://www.aca.ntu.edu.tw/w/aca/GAADForms.

The fonts under fonts/ are redistributed under their own licences and are not
covered by the MIT grant above. Both licences require their terms to accompany
the font files, so the full text and the verbatim copyright notices are in
fonts/OFL.txt, which must stay with the fonts if you redistribute them.

  - fonts/chinese/TW-Kai-98_1.ttf and fonts/chinese/TW-Sung-98_1.ttf are the
    全字庫正楷體 and 全字庫正宋體, (c) 2026 Ministry of Digital Affairs
    (數位發展部), obtained from https://data.gov.tw/dataset/5961. The publisher
    offers a choice of the Open Government Data License, version 1.0, or
    OFL-1.1. The Open Government Data License asks that the source be
    attributed; this notice and fonts/OFL.txt do so.
  - fonts/english/Tinos-*.ttf are Tinos, Copyright 2010 Google Inc., designed
    by Steve Matteson, licensed under OFL-1.1.

Both fonts are redistributed unmodified.

No proprietary font is bundled. Times New Roman, 標楷體, and 新細明體 must come
from your own system; see fonts/README.md.
